  (text "ModeA2: internal bias, adaptive threshold and zero-crossing enabled.\nSupply4.5..5.5V; input absolute current +/-40mA is NOT an operating/protection target.\n10k input resistors/filter are a reference-derived starting point; VR amplitude,\nresistor pulse rating, cranking sensitivity, tooth polarity and EMI require bench review.\nPB1 uses EXTI1 with scheduler timestamp: not a TIM3 capture channel shared with motors."
    (at 25.4 205 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "0b769d23-4fea-551d-a149-d8795ffb824b"))
